+// The stealth identity claims the operating system the engine actually runs
+// on. The OS shows through below the browser layer -- the TCP/IP stack
+// (initial TTL, window size, options) and the machine's own timing -- so a
+// Windows claim from a Linux host is a mismatch bot defences check for.
+// Measured on 2026-09-23 from a Linux host: real Chrome whose UA and client
+// hints were overridden to Windows got Amazon's "Continue shopping" captcha on
+// 4 of 5 loads, and 0 of 4 with its own Linux identity.
+//
+// The wreq emulation (Profile::Chrome145 on STEALTH_WREQ_PLATFORM) sends
